, state polls, or expert ratings are yet available for the general election.\n\nHeadlines so far focus on the still-forming 2028 primary fields on both sides, including speculation about a possible run by Senator John Kennedy, and on redistricting disputes involving Louisiana rather than general-election polling. With only fundamentals to rely on, the race is rated Likely Republican, with wide uncertainty reflecting how early the cycle is and how little state-specific evidence exists.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.108, "margin": -11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.162, "margin": -11.0}]}